## 2873.Maximum Value of Ordered Triplet

```java
public long maximumTripletValue(int[] nums) {
        long maxDifference = 0, maxElement =0, maxTriplet = 0;
        for (int num : nums) {
            maxTriplet = Math.max(maxTriplet, maxDifference * (long)num);
            maxDifference = Math.max(maxDifference, maxElement - num);
            maxElement = Math.max(maxElement, num);
        }
        return maxTriplet;
    }
